{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.3, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.6"
  description: "A one-position tuple of `text`, declared with `meta.tuple`, given `[_]`. The position is not voidable, so the void sentinel does not fill it; a position stating `voidable: true` admits it."
